@model CL.Web.Controllers.ElencoDocumentiViewModel<CL.Web.Controllers.RigaStorico>
@using CL.Domain.Documenti
@inject UtenteCorrente Utente
@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Archivio storico";
    var ritorno = Context.Request.Path + Context.Request.QueryString;
    var tipo = ViewBag.Tipo as string;
    var colonne = 4 + (Utente.IsConsulente ? 1 : 0);
}
<div class="breadcrumb-titolo d-flex flex-wrap align-items-center justify-content-between gap-2 mb-3">
    <h1 class="titolo-pagina mb-0">@ViewData["Title"]</h1>
</div>

<form asp-action="Storico" method="get" class="invoice-filter-bar customer-filter-form mb-3">
    <div class="invoice-filter-toolbar flex-wrap">
        @if (Model.Aziende is not null)
        {
            <div>
                <select name="aziendaId" class="form-select" aria-label="Filtra per azienda">
                    <option value="">Tutte le aziende</option>
                    @foreach (var a in Model.Aziende) { <option value="@a.Value" selected="@a.Selected">@a.Text</option> }
                </select>
            </div>
        }
        <div>
            <select name="anno" class="form-select" aria-label="Anno">
                <option value="">Tutti gli anni</option>
                @foreach (var a in Model.Anni) { <option value="@a" selected="@(a == Model.Anno)">@a</option> }
            </select>
        </div>
        <div>
            <select name="tipo" class="form-select" aria-label="Tipo di documento">
                <option value="">Tutti i documenti</option>
                @foreach (var t in Enum.GetValues<TipoDocumentoStorico>()) { <option value="@t" selected="@(t.ToString() == tipo)">@t.Descrizione()</option> }
            </select>
        </div>
        <div class="invoice-filter-actions"><button class="btn invoice-filter-submit" type="submit">Cerca <i class="ri-search-line" aria-hidden="true"></i></button></div>
    </div>
</form>

<div class="card radius-15 table-responsive table-actions-responsive p-1 customer-results">
    <table class="table mb-0 align-middle">
        <thead>
            <tr>
                <th scope="col">Anno</th>
                @if (Utente.IsConsulente) { <th scope="col">Azienda</th> }
                <th scope="col">Documento</th>
                <th scope="col">Caricato il</th>
                <th scope="col" class="text-end">Azioni</th>
            </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
            @if (Model.Righe.Count == 0)
            {
                <tr><td colspan="@colonne" class="elenco-vuoto"><span class="elenco-vuoto-icona" aria-hidden="true"><i class="ri-archive-line"></i></span><div>Nessun documento nell'archivio</div></td></tr>
            }
            @foreach (var r in Model.Righe)
            {
                <tr>
                    <td data-label="Anno">@r.Anno</td>
                    @if (Utente.IsConsulente) { <td data-label="Azienda">@r.Azienda</td> }
                    <td data-label="Documento"><a asp-action="ApriStorico" asp-route-id="@r.Id" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="link-contratto"><i class="ri-file-line" aria-hidden="true"></i> @r.Titolo</a></td>
                    <td data-label="Caricato il">@r.CaricatoIl.ToLocalTime().ToString("dd/MM/yyyy")</td>
                    <td data-label="Azioni">
                        <div class="customer-actions">
                            <a asp-action="ApriStorico" asp-route-id="@r.Id" target="_blank" rel="noopener" title="Apri" aria-label="Apri @r.Titolo @r.Anno"><i class="ri-eye-line" aria-hidden="true"></i></a>
                            <form asp-action="EliminaStorico" method="post" class="m-0" onsubmit="return confirm('Eliminare questo documento?');">
                                <input type="hidden" name="id" value="@r.Id" />
                                <input type="hidden" name="ritorno" value="@ritorno" />
                                <button type="submit" title="Elimina" aria-label="Elimina @r.Titolo @r.Anno"><i class="ri-delete-bin-line" aria-hidden="true"></i></button>
                            </form>
                        </div>
                    </td>
                </tr>
            }
        </tbody>
    </table>
</div>
